Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value IPADDR (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+|unassigned)
Value OK (\S+)
Value METHOD (\S+)
Value STATUS (\S+)
Value PROTOCOL (\S+)

Start
  ^Interface\s+IP-Address -> Header
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IPADDR}\s+${OK}\s+${METHOD}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record

Header
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+${IPADDR}\s+${OK}\s+${METHOD}\s+${STATUS}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record
